    <note id="bqP">
      <content>
        <p>Our answer is a living digital twin. Instead of reasoning about the world from a static model, you build a checkable, playable community that runs on its own, and you run its future forward. You inject the decision you are considering, or a rumor, and watch how it spreads. The loop is simple: simulate, intervene, forecast. That loop is the core of the product, and it is what the next slide shows in detail.</p>
